# The model artifacts (720 MB int8 ONNX graph, 725 MB prefill graph, 764 MB QNN
# context, 508 MB fp16 embedding table) are built, not source, so they are not
# committed: the recipe fetches them from the GitHub release (see
# QWEN35_MODEL_URL in qwen35-npu_1.0.bb).  This directory is only where a local
# build or an offline QWEN35_MODEL_URL=file://... keeps them.
files/model/
# py_compile / imports during development
__pycache__/
*.pyc
